                                "sense_id": "35732d05-8ddf-3762-b10c-7c7e0a99ee39",
                                "text": "1937, J. R. R. Tolkien, The Hobbit [Chapter 14 - Fire and Water],\nHis last throes splintered it to sparks and gledes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4466329a-b8c6-4f8c-a793-fb5a3d83a068",
                                "sense_id": "35732d05-8ddf-3762-b10c-7c7e0a99ee39",
                                "text": "1955, J. R. R. Tolkien, The Fellowship of the Ring [Book 2, Chapter 2 - The Council of Elrond],\nIt was hot when I first took it, hot as a glede, and my hand was scorched, so that I doubt if ever again I shall be free of the pain of it."
                            }
